  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SW London Music School teaching children in need</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Reach out and Play project will give local children with special needs (SEND), autism and those from disadvantaged backgrounds the chance to play a musical instrument and perform in front of an audience!  We&apos;ll provide 20 local families on low income up to 6 months of free lessons, and additionally will assist 100 current students with the cost of lessons, books, instrument hire and grade fees.</narrative>
  </description>
